<poem-grid :title="poemTitle" :author="author" :theme="bgTheme">

  <!-- Header Section -->
  <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-0.png" alt="" slot="header-tl" />
  <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-1.png" alt="" slot="header-tr" />

  <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-1-images">
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-6.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-8.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-10.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-12.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-14.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-16.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      Farming is so healthy and rewarding,
      For as the soil you till;
      You are living close to nature,
      As you perform our Saviour’s will.
    </p>

    <p>
      We’ve been put upon this planet,
      To cultivate the land;
      Sowing, tending, harvesting,
      Guided by our Maker’s hand.
    </p>

    <p>
      He who guides the growing force,
      The sunshine and the rain;
      Filling streams with water,
      And swelling ears of grain.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
  <div slot="col-3-images">
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-2.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-3.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-october/image-4.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 4 Text -->
  <div slot="col-4-text">
    <p>
      Ripening fruit and vegetables,
      Grown for us all to eat;
      The grass for sheep and cattle,
      A source of milk and meat.
    </p>

    <p>
      Wool for coats and blankets,
      To keep out the winter chill;
      If we work with our Provider,
      He will all our needs fulfil.
    </p>

    <p>
      Yes! Farming families down the years,
      Have been our Earth’s mainstay;
      So we thank our Lord for the Harvest,
      In our heartfelt prayers today.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-5-images">
